  "title": "Big Vehicles Need Bigger Brakes: Brembo Boldika Answers the Call",
  "summary": "How heavy are big pickup trucks and high-performance electric SUVs these days? Heavy enough that domestic manufacturers asked Brembo for bigger, more powerful brakes. The Italian outfit’s solution: the Boldika. It’s a new, bigger six-piston caliper with a unique design that allows for nearly 6300 lb-ft of braking torque. That’s the most powerful caliper Brembo […]",
